+# CONTRACT: T8 Analytics Dashboard
+
+## Architecture decisions
+- Shared `src/db.ts`: `setDb`/`getDb`/`createTestDb`/`closeDb` — in-memory sqlite for tests, schema loaded from `schema.sql`.
+- Shared `src/errors.ts`: `AppError` subclasses (`ValidationError` 400, `AuthError` 401, `ForbiddenError` 403, `NotFoundError` 404, `ConflictError` 409) + `errorHandler` Express middleware emitting `{error, code}`.
+- Shared `src/auth.ts`: `signToken(userId, tenantId)` producing JWT `{sub, tid, iat, exp}`; `optionalAuth` (parses Bearer token if present, sets `req.user = {id, tenantId}`, 401 on invalid token); `requireAuth` (optionalAuth + 401 if no `req.user`); `getAuthUser(req)` throws `AuthError` if `req.user` missing — used inside route handlers so unit tests that inject `req.user` via mock middleware (bypassing real JWT parsing) still work.
+- `src/app.ts`: `createApp()` wires `express.json()`, mounts `/users` with `optionalAuth` (register/login are public, `/me` and `/:id/role` check `getAuthUser` internally), mounts `/events`, `/query`, `/dashboards`, `/export` behind `requireAuth`, then `errorHandler`.
+- All queries scoped by `tenant_id` derived from `req.user.tenantId` — never trusted from request body/params.
+- Passwords hashed with Node's built-in `crypto.scryptSync` (salt:hash), no plaintext storage.
+
+## Behaviors to verify (-> tests/*.test.ts)
+- [x] POST /users registers user, 201, returns id/email/tenant_id/role=viewer — tests/users.unit.test.ts
+- [x] Duplicate email -> 409 — tests/users.unit.test.ts
+- [x] POST /users/login correct creds -> 200 + token + user — tests/users.unit.test.ts
+- [x] POST /users/login wrong password -> 401 — tests/users.unit.test.ts
+- [x] GET /users/me with authed context -> 200 profile — tests/users.unit.test.ts
+- [x] PATCH /users/:id/role admin-only -> 200 updated role — tests/users.unit.test.ts
+- [x] POST /events ingest single, tenant_id from auth — tests/ingest.unit.test.ts
+- [x] POST /events missing name -> 400 — tests/ingest.unit.test.ts
+- [x] POST /events/batch inserts N, returns inserted count + events — tests/ingest.unit.test.ts
+- [x] POST /events/batch empty array -> 400 — tests/ingest.unit.test.ts
+- [x] custom timestamp passthrough — tests/ingest.unit.test.ts
+- [x] POST /query/count with/without time range — tests/query.unit.test.ts
+- [x] POST /query/timeseries buckets by day — tests/query.unit.test.ts
+- [x] POST /query/breakdown groups by JSON property — tests/query.unit.test.ts
+- [x] POST /query/funnel monotonic non-increasing step counts — tests/query.unit.test.ts
+- [x] query without event_name -> 400 — tests/query.unit.test.ts
+- [x] Dashboards full CRUD + widgets sub-resource — tests/dashboards.unit.test.ts
+- [x] GET /export/events?format=json|csv, tenant-scoped, invalid format -> 400 — tests/export.unit.test.ts
+- [x] GET /export/dashboard/:id -> {dashboard, widgets}, 404 if missing — tests/export.unit.test.ts
+- [x] JWT shape {sub, tid, iat, exp} — tests/integration.test.ts
+- [x] Consistent {error, code} 401 across all protected routes, missing + invalid token — tests/integration.test.ts
+- [x] End-to-end flows with real JWT across all features — tests/integration.test.ts
+- [x] Tenant isolation: queries, dashboards, export all scoped — tests/integration.test.ts
+
+## Verification commands
+- `npm test` (vitest run)
+- `npm run build` (tsc)
+- `npm run lint` (eslint src/ tests/)
